        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Will Finn, David Lowery, Toby Halbrooks, James Whitaker, Daniel St. Pierre\n- Companies: Walt Disney Feature Animation, Walt Disney Pictures\n- Films: Home on the Range, Pete's Dragon, Chicken Little, Legends of Oz: Dorothy's Return\n\nFacts:\n- Home on the Range is a 2004 American animated musical western comedy film produced by Walt Disney Feature Animation and released by Walt Disney Pictures.\n- Will Finn wrote and directed Home on the Range.\n- Will Finn did voice acting as the Hollywood Fish in Chicken Little.\n- Pete's Dragon is a 2016 American fantasy comedy-drama adventure film directed by David Lowery, written by David Lowery and Toby Halbrooks, and produced by James Whitaker.\n- Legends of Oz: Dorothy's Return was directed by Daniel St. Pierre and Will Finn.",
